# No Git/GitHub Restore

Never restore, checkout, reset, revert, or otherwise recover anything from Git/GitHub.

Only the user may perform Git/GitHub restore or rollback operations.

You may inspect and report Git status/history if requested, but must never change repository history or restore files from source control.
